  "description": "Ready for your next gravel adventure? The URS ONE strikes the perfect balance of gravel-ready geometry, lightweight design, and user-friendly features. Its innovative frame and fork offer everything you need: large downtube storage, multiple cargo mounts, a D-shape seatpost for superior compliance, and reinforced protectors to safeguard the carbon from impacts. Equipped with the SRAM Apex groupset, an upgraded stem and gravel bar combo, new AG 20 aluminum wheelsets, and 44mm WTB Raddler tires, this gravel and bike packing bike is ready for any challenge. With the URS ONE, you’re set to tackle any terrain, embrace every adventure, and push your limits further than ever.",
